{
  "format": 2,
  "kind": "session",
  "name": "Per-room recovery of a thread room",
  "description": "Top-level rooms recover when announced; the thread room 103 loads only on loadRoom, as its own room with H = 107: its newest page first, then an older page on loadOlder. A move (log 104) appears in both rooms' history and re-homes the message whichever page arrives first. Thread pages mix room records, snapshots, and reactions (server limit 3); a live thread record above H is buffered.",
